# The module-local planner. `eci-active maintain-planner` refreshes it after publishing
# bin/eci-command-plan (tools/eci-active/planner.go), and shell tests under hooks/tests
# run it (test-validate-bash-classifier.sh) or build it with
# `go build -trimpath -buildvcs=false -o eci-command-plan .`. The Go tests use the
# planner TestMain publishes into their private HOME instead. Never tracked.
/eci-command-plan
